I tested with a single population and it works fine for me (latest dev version of dartR). Maybe you have 0,0 coordinate for one individual in your data set?

Can you check your coordinates in

gl@other$latlon

and check if there are some coordinates missing or zero?

Cheers, Bernd

If not can you send me the file as an r object

saveRDS(gl, file=“gl.rdata”)

so I can reproduce the error.

Thanks Bernd

